==Description==
The '''LiveLaugh Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 9 of the premium [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{Bunz|240}} or {{Robux|68}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bunz|1,150}} or {{Robux|585}}.

The '''LiveLaugh Nametag''' has white text with a black outline. The words "live" and "laugh" appear above the tag respectively in a different font, text color and a dark text shadow instead of an outline.

